\n\
1. Call get_action_choices with no board_cursor so you can see the ability list:\n\
   get_action_choices()\n\
\n\
2. You’ll get something like:\n\
   response_type = index  \n\
   choices:  \n\
   0 – Draw two cards  \n\
   1 – Destroy target artifact  \n\
   2 – Deal 5 damage to target creature\n\
\n\
3. Pick the damage mode:  \n\
   choose_action(index=2)\n\
\n\
4. The server will then prompt for a target (GAME_TARGET). Target the Fleshraker:  \n\
   choose_action(id=\"p23\")\n\
\n\
After that the spell will resolve. You still have all four lands untapped, so you’ll hold up mana for interaction on their turn.\n\
\n\
(If the mode list numbering differs, just select the entry whose text is “{this} deals 5 damage to target creature.”)",
