- I targeted `Tundra` (288).\n\
- Then I see \"T4 Precombat Main/Precombat Main\" (292) with `Liquimetal Coating` tapped.\n\
- Then I passed priority (292 -> 293).\n\
- Then I am in T4 Combat/Declare Attackers (294).\n\
\n\
Wait! I passed priority because I thought I was waiting for the `Liquimetal Coating` ability to resolve.\n\
But `Liquimetal Coating` ability IS instant speed, but Karn's loyalty ability is sorcery speed.\n\
Wait, I activated `Liquimetal Coating` (target Tundra).\n\
Then I passed priority.\n\
Then it resolved.\n\
Then active player (me) got priority again.\n\
In game_seq 292, I had priority in Main Phase.\n\
I passed priority! NO!\n\
I should have activated Karn in game_seq 292!\n\
\n\
