Hand: `Karn` (4), `Mystic Forge` (4).\n\
I need 4 mana.\n\
I have `Opal` (1) + `Tomb` (2) = 3 mana.\n\
Wait, I used Tower for Key.\n\
So I have 3 mana.\n\
Not enough for `Mystic Forge` or `Karn`.\n\
