Cast -> Create Spawn -> Damage (1). Opp -> 3.\n\
Karn enters. Not creature.\n\
So total 2 damage from casting Key + Karn.\n\
Opponent at 3.\n\
Attack with Unblockable Fleshraker (2).\n\
Opponent at 1.\n\
I need 1 more damage.\n\
I have `Manifold Key`.\n\
Can I untap something to deal damage?\n\
Untap `Walking Ballista`? Don't have one.\n\
Untap `Grim Monolith` to get mana?\n\
Untap `Ancient Tomb` (if artifact)?\n\
Untap `Mystic Forge` (p67)? It's tapped.\n\
I can untap Forge with NEW Key (p98) and dig again!\n\
If I find a colorless spell -> Cast -> 1 damage.\n\
Total damage = 1 (Key spawn) + 1 (Karn spawn) + 2 (Attack) + 1 (New Spell spawn) = 5.\n\
LETHAL.\n\
\n\
Wait, New Key (p98) enters UNTAPPED.\n\
It can use its abilities immediately.\n\
I can use {1}, {T}: Untap Forge.\n\
