Fleshraker blocked by Loch Mare -> 0 damage.\n\
So digging is risky if I miss.\n\
But unblockable attack leaves Opp at 1.\n\
Opp at 1 with Loch Mare vs my board. Next turn I surely win?\n\
Unless they have removal / combo.\n\
