- Exiled Portable Hole -> `Manifold Key` (in hand? No, unseen).\n\
- Cast `Manifold Key` from hand.\n\
Wait, if I cast Key from hand, top of library remains `Unknown`.\n\
So if I untap Forge and dig, I see ONE card.\n\
Is it worth risking 2 damage (Attack) for potential 1 damage (Dig)?\n\
If I attack, Opp at 1.\n\
If I dig and miss, Opp at 3.\n\
And my Fleshraker gets blocked.\n\
Attack is safer. Opp at 1 is very dead.\n\
Unless I can do BOTH?\n\
Key abilities costs {1}, {T} (Untap) OR {3}, {T} (Unblockable).\n\
Key requires TAP.\n\
So I can only do ONE.\n\
Unblockable is guaranteed damage.\n\
Dig is random.\n\
So Unblockable is correct.\n\
Opp at 1 is fine.\n\
Wait, I can cast `Karn` (p4) BEFORE combat.\n\
Populate board.\n\
Maybe Karn finds something?\n\
-2 Karn: Reveal artifact from outside game or exile.\n\
