`Kozilek's Command`?\n\
`Urza's Saga`? (Land).\n\
Sideboard? `Liquimetal Coating`, `Ensnaring Bridge`, `Wurmcoil Engine`, `City of Traitors`, `Walking Ballista`?\n\
